      <svg class="ct-spark" style="width:22px;bottom:28px;left:30%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 0 L14 10 L24 12 L14 14 L12 24 L10 14 L0 12 L10 10 Z"></path></svg>
